OL,3,AMicrosoft pulls out of UK's largest AI
OL,4,Adata centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tech company has said it still plans
OL,7,Fto build the UK's largest AI data
OL,8,Fcentre despite Microsoft pulling out of
OL,9,Fthe project.
OL,11,FNscale announced last year it had
OL,12,Fpledged #2bn to build and open a
OL,13,Fpioneering facility in Loughton, Essex.
OL,15,FHowever, the BBC understands that
OL,16,FMicrosoft, which said it would fund a
OL,17,Fsupercomputer at the site, has
OL,18,Fterminated its involvement.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
