OL,3,AMicrosoft pulls out of UK's largest AI
OL,4,Adata centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Nscale said it was
OL,7,Fexploring alternative power sources and
OL,8,Fits relationship with Microsoft
OL,9,Fremained strong for their other
OL,10,Fprojects together overseas. Microsoft
OL,11,Fdeclined to comment.
